a-colorid=3Dhfm3wd1fjb]{color:#e5e7f1}[data-colorid=3Drmtqufq974]{color:#0e=
101a} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Drmtqufq974]{color:#e5e7f=
1}</style><strong>Overview</strong></h1>
<p>Tripadvisor uses three types of badges to communicate to our travelers t=
hat there is concern regarding a property listed on our site. These badges =
are posted to the top of the listing's page on Tripadvisor to alert travele=
rs.&nbsp;</p>
<h1 id=3D"id-46.Badges.RedBadge,LockdownBadge,SensitiveNotificationBadge.-L=
ockdown&amp;SensitiveIssuesBadges"><strong>Lockdown &amp; Sensitive Issues =
Badges</strong></h1>
<p>Tripadvisor is meant to be a place where users share their personal expe=
riences after having genuine, first-hand customer service experience with a=
 property. Unfortunately, this is not always the case. We have seen time an=
d time again that, for various reasons, individuals are periodically drawn =
to Tripadvisor to submit content that does not detail a first-hand experien=
ce.</p>
<p>Sometimes this is done in good faith (such as trying to warn other membe=
rs of some concern regarding the property), and sometimes, it is done in ba=
d faith (such as submitting knowingly damaging content to a property with w=
hich they have some political or social axe to grind). Regardless of the us=
er's intent, we do not allow non-first-hand experiences to be published on =
the site.</p>
<p>There are two different approaches to dealing with a property that's in =
the news and attracting reviews that may or may not describe an actual FHE =
with the property.</p>
<h2 id=3D"id-46.Badges.RedBadge,LockdownBadge,SensitiveNotificationBadge.-1=
)LockdownBadge"><strong>1) Lockdown Badge</strong></h2>
<p><span data-colorid=3D"d5inytz8xd">In this situation, we take steps to au=
to-remove&nbsp;<u>all</u>&nbsp;incoming content for the listing for a perio=
d of time as member fraud,&nbsp;</span><em><span data-colorid=3D"dauh4m8om4=
"><u>even if there might be some apparent first-hand experiences during tha=
t time frame.</u>&nbsp;</span></em><span data-colorid=3D"hfm3wd1fjb">The ra=
tionale behind that decision is as follows:</span></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><span data-colorid=3D"xwl5t822xa">The odds of someone submitting a genui=
ne first-hand experience during a time under which the property is at the c=
enter of some media firestorm are low.</span></p></li>
<li>
<p><span data-colorid=3D"uhahnuml69">The odds that someone might try to dam=
age the property by submitting a false report of a first-hand experience ar=
e high.</span></p></li>
<li>
<p><span data-colorid=3D"rmtqufq974">In many of these situations, the sheer=
 volume of incoming content makes it impractical for us to sift through the=
 reviews and determine which look genuine and which do not.</span></p></li>
<li>
<p><span data-colorid=3D"zrl6ofm4s6">We want to show that we are not choosi=
ng sides in these situations and that we've temporarily shut off the flow o=
f reviews.</span></p></li>
<li>
<p><span data-colorid=3D"q4flarzw3f">Shutting off all reviews has a proven =
chilling effect on the influx of non-FHE content; we're disincentivizing us=
ers from engaging in this kind of behavior by taking a hard stance.</span><=
/p></li>
</ul>
<p><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">Lockdowns can&nbsp;</span><stron=
g>only be instated by the Investigations team</strong><span class=3D"legacy=
-color-text-blue3">. </span></p>
<p><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-green2">If an owner or user inquires ab=
out a property with a Lockdown badge displayed on their listing's page, ple=
ase escalate the ticket to the Investigations Team</span><span class=3D"leg=
acy-color-text-blue3"> as outlined </span><a href=3D"https://tripadvisor.at=
lassian.net/wiki/display/ASK/19.+Escalations+to+Other+Teams#id-19.Escalatio=
nstoOtherTeams-n.0" rel=3D"nofollow"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3=
">here</span></a><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">.&nbsp; &nbsp;</sp=
an></p>
<p><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">This is what a Lockdown Badge lo=
oks like on the live site.&nbsp;</span></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedd=
ed-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img cl=
ass=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy"=
 src=3D"19ea8242e64f835ad115ed8c8d70f57e6eba1d1f9a630fc9ed7f6104d1f6ef14" d=
ata-image-src=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachment=
s/300104247/Lockdown%20badge.png?version=3D2&amp;modificationDate=3D1677785=
183547&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"1585" data-width=
=3D"2558" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"30=
0104248" data-linked-resource-version=3D"2" data-linked-resource-type=3D"at=
tachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Lockdown badge.png" data-ba=
se-url=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-cont=
ent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"300104247" data=
-linked-resource-container-version=3D"4" data-media-id=3D"4623fcdf-74e0-477=
d-9df3-a5ea8f30a600" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"290"></span>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<h2 id=3D"id-46.Badges.RedBadge,LockdownBadge,SensitiveNotificationBadge.-2=
)SensitiveIssuesBadge"><strong>2) Sensitive Issues Badge</strong></h2>
<p><span data-colorid=3D"euc79g1iw7">Sensitive Issue Notifications are rese=
rved only for the most severe of circumstances, such as when we receive a r=
eport of a death, sexual or physical assault, or some persistent risk of da=
nger at a property, and when we are, for whatever reason, not able to publi=
sh any reviews detailing said risks.</span></p>
<p><span data-colorid=3D"suquz4uaxn">These are&nbsp;</span><strong><span da=
ta-colorid=3D"x65qtw53uo">only</span></strong><span data-colorid=3D"avibsru=
lm1">&nbsp;used when the approving parties (consisting of stakeholders from=
 legal, content, and PR) can confidently determine either via trustworthy m=
edia reports or&nbsp;</span><em><span data-colorid=3D"lxetqfafla">unpublish=
ed</span></em><span data-colorid=3D"lx8ku5sd8o">&nbsp;user review submissio=
ns that the conditions at a business may pose extraordinary and significant=
 risks to travelers.</span></p>
<p><span data-colorid=3D"nwe16ckl9y">Sensitive Issue Notifications are to b=
e posted&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-colorid=3D"m1aral3pa3">only by Inve=
stigations Team members</span></strong><span data-colorid=3D"m05r2fpiu8">.<=
/span></p>
<p><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-green2">If an owner or user inquires ab=
out a property with a Sensitive Issues badge displayed on their listing's p=
age, please escalate the ticket to the Investigations Team</span><span clas=
s=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3"> as outlined </span><a href=3D"https://tripad=
visor.atlassian.net/wiki/display/ASK/19.+Escalations+to+Other+Teams#id-19.E=
scalationstoOtherTeams-n.0" rel=3D"nofollow"><span class=3D"legacy-color-te=
xt-blue3">here</span></a><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">.&nbsp; &n=
bsp;</span></p>
<p><span data-colorid=3D"nqmw0gzlmr">Below is an example of what this notic=
e looks like on a live listing:</span></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedde=
d-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img cla=
ss=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" =
src=3D"11cf45618105685daadcb3d02827aa7c5f6ac577149878c68f0fa1b3ab06e479" da=
ta-image-src=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments=
/300104247/Sensitive%20Issues:Media%20Badge.png?version=3D2&amp;modificatio=
nDate=3D1677785801191&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"628=
" data-width=3D"2354" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resou=
rce-id=3D"300104249" data-linked-resource-version=3D"2" data-linked-resourc=
e-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Sensitive Issue=
s:Media Badge.png" data-base-url=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/wiki"=
 data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-conta=
iner-id=3D"300104247" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"4" data-med=
ia-id=3D"908bd867-7752-48d8-a93d-73615f393243" data-media-type=3D"file" hei=
ght=3D"124"></span>
<p></p>
<h1 id=3D"id-46.Badges.RedBadge,LockdownBadge,SensitiveNotificationBadge.-3=
)RedBadge"><strong>3) Red Badge</strong></h1>
<p>When a property repeatedly violates our guidelines, Tripadvisor can affi=
x what is referred to as a Red Badge (RB) to their listing's page on our li=
ve site. This RB lets users know that we detected violations. For example, =
we use this when a property has received multiple fraud letters and, despit=
e these, continues to commit fraud. We also use an RB when an owner resorts=
 to extreme bullying. Extreme bullying is when a property representative th=
reatens a user's life, family, business, or reputation or intends to interf=
ere with their professional or personal life. Cases of extreme bullying mus=
t be escalated to T2 immediately.</p>
<p>Red Badges can <strong>only be posted by the Investigations Team and Fra=
ud Support Tier 2</strong> agents after approval by the legal team.</p>
<p><span data-colorid=3D"eepklymcq3">Below is an example of what this notic=
e looks like on a live listing:</span></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedde=
d-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img cla=
ss=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" =
src=3D"dd8956cc6e4af10e0e9846aa4859221e39bf6ec7f280c8dd8364c4a540388e02" da=
ta-image-src=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments=
/300104247/Red%20Badge%20Example.png?version=3D2&amp;modificationDate=3D167=
7785848736&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"476" data-widt=
h=3D"2537" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"3=
00104250" data-linked-resource-version=3D"2" data-linked-resource-type=3D"a=
ttachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Red Badge Example.png" dat=
a-base-url=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-=
content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"300104247" =
data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"4" data-media-id=3D"155e9a85-a8af=
-4a40-8b98-a6662caff7f3" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"87"></span>
<p></p>
<h2 id=3D"id-46.Badges.RedBadge,LockdownBadge,SensitiveNotificationBadge.-W=
hattheseBadgeslooklikeinourtools"><strong>What these Badges look like in ou=
r tools</strong></h2>
<p>The <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://tonic.tripadvisor.com/Loc=
ationCenter" rel=3D"nofollow">Location Center</a> holds all information reg=
arding badges applied to a listing, active as well as inactive.&nbsp;</p>
<h3 id=3D"id-46.Badges.RedBadge,LockdownBadge,SensitiveNotificationBadge.-L=
ockdownandSensitiveNotificationBadgeinformationintheLC:">Lockdown and Sensi=
tive Notification Badge information in the LC:</h3>
<p></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
ge-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"238588ae475b74a78573e4640d39=
03a6293f2524dc558cefa6fc1c86cdf6b916" data-image-src=3D"https://tripadvisor=
.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/300104247/LC%20Badge%20View.png?ve=
rsion=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1677622054952&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=
=3Dv2" data-height=3D"1832" data-width=3D"3488" data-unresolved-comment-cou=
nt=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"300104252" data-linked-resource-version=
=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-defaul=
t-alias=3D"LC Badge View.png" data-base-url=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassia=
n.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-res=
ource-container-id=3D"300104247" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"=
4" data-media-id=3D"ea7550ff-867e-499a-9eec-f1fc9846b040" data-media-type=
=3D"file" height=3D"245"></span>
<p></p>
<h3 id=3D"id-46.Badges.RedBadge,LockdownBadge,SensitiveNotificationBadge.-R=
edBadgeinformationintheLC:">Red Badge information in the LC:</h3>
<p>Red Badge information is highlighted in five different places in the LC.=
</p>
<p>At the very top next to the property's name, under "Fraud Penalty Histor=
y", "Notice History" on the left-hand side, and twice on the right-hand sid=
e under "Lockdown" and "Fraud Penalty".</p>
<p>Note that <u>the most up-to-date information about a Red Badge can be fo=
und in the Location Center</u> vs. the live site listing. Notice that the l=
isting below was "badged" on January 4th, 2023 ("Fraud Penalty History", Ti=
me "2023-01-04 16:06), but the Fraud Notice on the actual listing won't dis=
play until January 16th, 2023. Why the difference? When we badge a property=
, we notify the owner, letting them know they will be penalized on our site=
 with a Red Badge. We give them a couple of weeks to contact us and explain=
 the situation before the badge goes live. This is their last chance to avo=
id this type of penalization. Keep this in mind when checking if a property=
 is badged or not. The notice may not be live on their listing's page but i=
t may already be scheduled to go live at some point in the future in our to=
ols, so <strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-green2">always check the L=
ocation Center first</span></strong>.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded=
